Subject: [PATCH 13/28] cellSaveData: cellSaveDataEnableOverlay (NID
 0xE7FA820B)

Records whether the system save-data overlay is wanted; this HLE draws
none either way.
---
 libs/system/cellSaveData.c | 108 ++++++++++++++++++++-----------------
 libs/system/cellSaveData.h |   3 ++
